{"id":"ccb1a85e29ea0a39","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-relativization.md","title":"集合论公式的相对化","display":"df-relativization — 集合论公式的相对化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-relativization","aliases":["18-df-relativization"],"display":"df-relativization — 集合论公式的相对化","depends_on":["[[./18-df-formula]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"§11.4 following Lemma 11.4.1; Definition 12.1.1","source_printed_pages":"249, 298","source_pdf_pages":"258, 306","source_correspondence":"explicit-local-expansion","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","source_proof_review":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited record; not a new source check","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-relativization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-relativization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relativization — 集合论公式的相对化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.4 following Lemma 11.4.1; Definition 12.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"249, 298"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"258, 306"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited record; not a new source check"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是包含二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span> 和逻辑等号的一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal L&#39;\\)</span> 是保留其变量枚举、仅扩张非逻辑符号的签名。项和公式取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 及其上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{BV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{BV}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a>，在本节点一律实例化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal L&#39;\\)</span>。旧公式通过同一有限树编码嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\">\\(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^u\">\\(F^u\\)</span> 的输入恰为下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\)</span> 中的二元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 及递归子公式只在该域内使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;})\">\\(\\forall F\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\\)</span> 为全部逻辑构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 按字母表展开。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^u\">\\(F^u\\)</span> 在公式构造树上递归，输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal L&#39;\\)</span> 的公式代码，不取模 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L&#39;=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L&#39;=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为新常元时，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 均为合法输入；不再要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是未扩张语言的项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}:\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}(u)\\cap\\mathrm{BV}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}(F)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}:\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}(u)\\cap\\mathrm{BV}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}(F)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA^u&amp;\\coloneqq A &amp;&amp;(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}),\\\\\n(\\neg F)^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg F^u,\\\\\n(F\\circ G)^u&amp;\\coloneqq(F^u\\circ G^u)\n&amp;&amp;(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\,F)^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(x\\in u\\to F^u),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\,F)^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,(x\\in u\\land F^u),\\\\\n\\Gamma^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F^u:F\\in\\Gamma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA^u&amp;\\coloneqq A &amp;&amp;(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}),\\\\\n(\\neg F)^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg F^u,\\\\\n(F\\circ G)^u&amp;\\coloneqq(F^u\\circ G^u)\n&amp;&amp;(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\,F)^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(x\\in u\\to F^u),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\,F)^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,(x\\in u\\land F^u),\\\\\n\\Gamma^u&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F^u:F\\in\\Gamma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\quad\nF^u\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}\\quad\nF^u\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L&#39;}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷 p.249 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^a\">\\(F^a\\)</span> 的说明及 Definition 12.1.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^U\">\\(A^U\\)</span>。这里在有限公式树上展开所有分支，递归的每次调用都落在严格子公式，故每个合法输入有唯一输出树。对变量项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 使用已显式满足的新鲜性前提，防止将相对化参数意外绑定；原子式及项本身不变。本节没有断言两边在任意不同结构中的真值相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含二元关系符号 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名，$\\mathcal L'$ 是保留其变量枚举、仅扩张非逻辑符号的签名。项和公式取 [[18-df-formula]] 及其上游；$\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{BV}$ 取 [[18-df-free-variable]]，在本节点一律实例化于 $\\mathcal L'$。旧公式通过同一有限树编码嵌入 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含二元关系符号 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名，$\\mathcal L'$ 是保留其变量枚举、仅扩张非逻辑符号的签名。项和公式取 [[18-df-formula]] 及其上游；$\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{BV}$ 取 [[18-df-free-variable]]，在本节点一律实例化于 $\\mathcal L'$。旧公式通过同一有限树编码嵌入 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{BV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L'}","display":false},{"tex":"F^u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L'}","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L'})","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"F^u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L'","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L'=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L'}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L'}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}:\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L'}(u)\\cap\\mathrm{BV}_{\\mathcal L'}(F)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nA^u&\\coloneqq A &&(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L'}),\\\\\n(\\neg F)^u&\\coloneqq\\neg F^u,\\\\\n(F\\circ G)^u&\\coloneqq(F^u\\circ G^u)\n&&(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\,F)^u&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(x\\in u\\to F^u),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\,F)^u&\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,(x\\in u\\land F^u),\\\\\n\\Gamma^u&\\coloneqq\\{F^u:F\\in\\Gamma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\langle u,F\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{RelDom}_{\\mathcal L'}\\quad\nF^u\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}.","display":true},{"tex":"F^a","display":false},{"tex":"A^U","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":3475,"backlinks":[{"id":"5dd0384f81f0e316","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$U\\notin C$ 是全新常元，$F^U$ 及 $T^U$ 是 [[./18-df-relativization]] 的捕获规避相对化。$\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}}$ 取 [[./18-df-kp-minus]]，$\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)$ 取 [[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]。"},{"id":"24c0bc5331222e31","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}]^{<\\omega}$。$D_k^{(m,s)}(\\Delta)$ 通过定义域恰为 $\\Delta$ 的选择函数取值，不使用未指定的公式枚举。目标语言为 $\\mathcal L_k=\\mathcal L\\cup\\{A_0,\\ldots,A_k\\}$；$F^{A_m}$ 使用 [[./18-df-relativization]] 在 $\\mathcal L_k$ 中的实例。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-relativization]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-relativization]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-relativization]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33","0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f"]}